+ * @MXL862XX_XPCS_RESET_VR: vendor-specific reset (fast)
+ * @MXL862XX_XPCS_RESET_SOFT: PCS soft reset
+ * @MXL862XX_XPCS_RESET_HARD: full hardware reset
